1
00:00:01,540 --> 00:00:05,251
I've booked the room already. 2430.
Come up whenever.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,500
(I've arrived.
Open the door for me.)

3
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:32,149
Book?

4
00:00:35,680 --> 00:00:39,320
Hey.
Are you… the one who leads or follows?

5
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:41,422
I usually lead…
but I want to try differently.

6
00:00:41,422 --> 00:00:42,639
Frame…

7
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:51,961
I can't believe it's you. I told myself
there's no way it would be you.

8
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:59,810
I'm going home.

9
00:01:00,586 --> 00:01:01,693
Wait— seriously?

10
00:01:01,887 --> 00:01:03,901
Give me my bag back.
Come on.

11
00:01:04,498 --> 00:01:06,277
You came all the way here
because you wanted to, right?

12
00:01:07,964 --> 00:01:11,249
Yeah… but now I don't think
I do anymore.

13
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:13,205
You sure about that?

14
00:01:15,295 --> 00:01:16,380
Frame…

15
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:24,667
Not interested? You sure?
A lot of people changed their minds real quick.

16
00:01:25,473 --> 00:01:27,000
Some even switched sides…
just for me.

17
00:01:33,680 --> 00:01:35,980
Frame— let go.
